// tidelink_lane_checker.flist
//
// Re-points the historical lane_checker flist at the new
// tidelink-gpio-phy submodule. The submodule provides:
//   - tidelink_training_patterns.svh    (PATTERN_W constants)
//   - tidelink_popcount16.sv            (16-bit popcount helper)
//   - tidelink_lane_checker_single.sv   (single-lane matcher + canary)
//   - tidelink_lane_checker.sv          (8-lane wrapper)
//   - tidelink_gpio_phy_apb_regs.sv     (APB slave for thresholds + obs)
//
// See deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/docs/TRAINING_MODULE_SPEC.md and
// INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md for the design rationale.

+incdir+${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/rtl
${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/rtl/tidelink_popcount16.sv
${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/rtl/tidelink_lane_checker_single.sv
${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/rtl/tidelink_lane_checker.sv
${TIDELINK_HOME}/deps/tidelink-gpio-phy/rtl/tidelink_gpio_phy_apb_regs.sv
